  "transcript": [
    {
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 12160,
      "text": "IELTS Listening Version 5 4165"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 12160,
      "endMs": 17480,
      "text": "You will hear a number of different recordings, and you will have to answer questions on what"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 17480,
      "endMs": 19480,
      "text": "you hear."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 19480,
      "endMs": 25320,
      "text": "There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions, and you will have a chance to"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 25320,
      "endMs": 27400,
      "text": "check your work."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 27400,
      "endMs": 31560,
      "text": "All the recordings will be played once only."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 31560,
      "endMs": 34960,
      "text": "The test is in four sections."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 34960,
      "endMs": 38200,
      "text": "Write all your answers in the listening question booklet."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 38200,
      "endMs": 44680,
      "text": "At the end of the test, you will be given ten minutes to transfer your answers to an"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 44680,
      "endMs": 47800,
      "text": "answer sheet."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 47800,
      "endMs": 52200,
      "text": "Now turn to section one on page two of your question booklet."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 57560,
      "endMs": 59800,
      "text": "Section one."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 59800,
      "endMs": 65120,
      "text": "You will hear a woman talking on the phone to a car salesman about some second hand cars"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 65120,
      "endMs": 67640,
      "text": "he has for sale."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 67640,
      "endMs": 72800,
      "text": "First you have some time to look at questions one to five on page two."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 87400,
      "endMs": 102720,
      "text": "You will see that there is an example that has been done for you."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 102720,
      "endMs": 109160,
      "text": "On this occasion only, the conversation relating to this will be played first."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 109160,
      "endMs": 117360,
      "text": "Woman: Hello, I heard your advert on the radio about the sale you're having, and I wanted to"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 117360,
      "endMs": 119280,
      "text": "find out about your cars."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 119280,
      "endMs": 124000,
      "text": "Salesman: Well you've called the right place, so how much do you want to spend?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 124000,
      "endMs": 133560,
      "text": "Woman: I'd like to spend about $4,000, but definitely no more than $4,300."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 133560,
      "endMs": 142160,
      "text": "The maximum the woman would like to spend is $4,300, so $4,300 has been written in the"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 142160,
      "endMs": 144440,
      "text": "space."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 144440,
      "endMs": 146400,
      "text": "Now we shall begin."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 146400,
      "endMs": 151280,
      "text": "You should answer the questions as you listen because you will not hear the recording"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 151280,
      "endMs": 153680,
      "text": "a second time."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 153680,
      "endMs": 160520,
      "text": "Listen carefully and answer questions one to five."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 160520,
      "endMs": 165920,
      "text": "Woman: Hello, I heard your advert on the radio about the sale you're having and I wanted to"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 165920,
      "endMs": 167880,
      "text": "find out about your cars."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 167880,
      "endMs": 172040,
      "text": "Salesman: Well you've called the right place, so how much do you want to spend?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 172520,
      "endMs": 178880,
      "text": "Woman: I'd like to spend about $4,000, but definitely no more than $4,300."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 178880,
      "endMs": 183720,
      "text": "Salesman: Okay, for that price we've got some nice cars, I've got a lovely Noda."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 183720,
      "endMs": 185120,
      "text": "Do you know that model?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 185120,
      "endMs": 187800,
      "text": "Woman: Yes, what color is it?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 187800,
      "endMs": 192120,
      "text": "I know it sounds unimportant, but there are certain colours I don't want."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 192120,
      "endMs": 194600,
      "text": "Salesman: Well this one is silver."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 194600,
      "endMs": 200560,
      "text": "Woman: That's good, because I don't want a dark colour like black, as they get too hot in summer,"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 200560,
      "endMs": 202200,
      "text": "so is it in good condition?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 202200,
      "endMs": 207040,
      "text": "Salesman: It's just had a state of the art stereo put in, and although one light is damaged, we'd"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 207040,
      "endMs": 209640,
      "text": "repair that for you if you decided to buy it."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 209640,
      "endMs": 211040,
      "text": "Woman: Oh, that's good of you."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 211040,
      "endMs": 213880,
      "text": "Salesman: I've also got a Comina, it's a white one."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 213880,
      "endMs": 217720,
      "text": "It's slightly more expensive than the Noda, but it's a good car."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 217720,
      "endMs": 221640,
      "text": "I know it quite well because it was owned by our manager here, so I used to get to drive"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 221640,
      "endMs": 223040,
      "text": "it quite a bit."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 223040,
      "endMs": 226520,
      "text": "Woman: The Comina is okay, but it's a little on the big side."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 226520,
      "endMs": 228800,
      "text": "Salesman: Well, how about a Telsta?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 228800,
      "endMs": 231880,
      "text": "They're smaller, but not too small."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 231880,
      "endMs": 233720,
      "text": "We've got an orange one of those."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 233720,
      "endMs": 236520,
      "text": "Actually, what kind of model were you after?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 236520,
      "endMs": 238000,
      "text": "This one's an automatic."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 238000,
      "endMs": 239000,
      "text": "Woman: Great."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 239000,
      "endMs": 244120,
      "text": "They are so much easier to drive than the manual model, although I'm fine with either."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 244120,
      "endMs": 249600,
      "text": "Salesman: And another good feature is that the previous owner only replaced its tyres last month."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 249600,
      "endMs": 255160,
      "text": "Woman: That will save some money, and anything to do with the wheels is so important for safety."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 255160,
      "endMs": 256320,
      "text": "It might be worth a look."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 256320,
      "endMs": 257320,
      "text": "Salesman: Okay."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 257320,
      "endMs": 260960,
      "text": "Now, let's look at what else we've got in your price range."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 260960,
      "endMs": 262440,
      "text": "How about an Abrada?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 262440,
      "endMs": 263440,
      "text": "It's a red one."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 263440,
      "endMs": 266200,
      "text": "It's the newest of the cars for sale in your bracket."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 266200,
      "endMs": 267200,
      "text": "Woman: How old is it?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 267200,
      "endMs": 270440,
      "text": "I doubt I could afford anything less than ten years old."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 270440,
      "endMs": 272040,
      "text": "Salesman: Well, you might be surprised."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 272040,
      "endMs": 275320,
      "text": "There was only one previous owner, and they had it eight years."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 275320,
      "endMs": 277880,
      "text": "All the others are at least nine years old."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 277880,
      "endMs": 278880,
      "text": "Woman: Hmm."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 278880,
      "endMs": 283880,
      "text": "Now, that's a possibility."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 283880,
      "endMs": 289040,
      "text": "Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions six"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 289040,
      "endMs": 291080,
      "text": "to ten on page two."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 313880,
      "endMs": 320880,
      "text": "Now, listen, and answer questions six to ten."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 320880,
      "endMs": 321880,
      "text": "Woman: Okay."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 321880,
      "endMs": 327200,
      "text": "Well, I'm interested in a couple of those."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 327200,
      "endMs": 328800,
      "text": "Could I come and take a look at them?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 328800,
      "endMs": 329800,
      "text": "Salesman: Sure."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 329800,
      "endMs": 330800,
      "text": "We're open seven days a week."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 330800,
      "endMs": 332480,
      "text": "Do you know where we are?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 332480,
      "endMs": 333480,
      "text": "Woman: I think so."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 333480,
      "endMs": 336440,
      "text": "You're on Station Road in Mitchell, right?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 336440,
      "endMs": 339320,
      "text": "I usually go past your place when I'm on the bus."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 339320,
      "endMs": 340320,
      "text": "Salesman: That's right."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 340320,
      "endMs": 341320,
      "text": "You can't miss us."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 341320,
      "endMs": 342720,
      "text": "What day would suit you?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 342760,
      "endMs": 347920,
      "text": "Don't leave it too long as these cars are likely to go quickly at these prices."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 347920,
      "endMs": 352440,
      "text": "Woman: Well, I couldn't get there before Wednesday, and even that might be pushing it."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 352440,
      "endMs": 353840,
      "text": "How does Thursday sound?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 353840,
      "endMs": 354800,
      "text": "Salesman: Sounds good."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 354800,
      "endMs": 358640,
      "text": "I usually don't work then or Fridays, but I am this week."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 358640,
      "endMs": 359560,
      "text": "Woman: That's good."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 359560,
      "endMs": 361480,
      "text": "I'd prefer to deal with you."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 361480,
      "endMs": 364280,
      "text": "Woman: Okay, so would nine thirty in the morning be okay?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 364280,
      "endMs": 365280,
      "text": "Salesman: No worries."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 365280,
      "endMs": 367760,
      "text": "When you arrive, ask for Gerald Smith."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 367760,
      "endMs": 371360,
      "text": "That's G-E-R-A-L-D."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 371360,
      "endMs": 372120,
      "text": "Woman: Okay."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 372160,
      "endMs": 375880,
      "text": "Salesman: Now, will you be coming by car or public transport?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 375880,
      "endMs": 378440,
      "text": "Woman: I'll probably come with my dad in his car."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 378440,
      "endMs": 380400,
      "text": "He knows all about this sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 380400,
      "endMs": 383280,
      "text": "Salesman: Well, you should be able to park at the supermarket."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 383280,
      "endMs": 386440,
      "text": "Parking can be a bit hard with all the businesses around here"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 386440,
      "endMs": 388480,
      "text": "and all our cars out the front."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 388480,
      "endMs": 389440,
      "text": "Woman: Great."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 389440,
      "endMs": 391960,
      "text": "Now, is there anything I need to bring with me?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 391960,
      "endMs": 393520,
      "text": "Salesman: Let me think."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 393520,
      "endMs": 395640,
      "text": "If you want to take the car for a test drive,"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 395640,
      "endMs": 397920,
      "text": "you'll need to have identification with you."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 397920,
      "endMs": 401680,
      "text": "I mean, otherwise you could just drive off and never come back."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 401720,
      "endMs": 402520,
      "text": "Woman: Okay."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 402520,
      "endMs": 403640,
      "text": "That's easy."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 403640,
      "endMs": 404480,
      "text": "Salesman: Perfect."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 404480,
      "endMs": 405640,
      "text": "See you later this week."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 408960,
      "endMs": 411720,
      "text": "That is the end of section one."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 411720,
      "endMs": 415440,
      "text": "You now have half a minute to check your answers."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 431680,
      "endMs": 448680,
      "text": "Now turn to section two on page three."
    }
  ],
